                        <ref target="#d635">635</ref>, <ref target="#d645">645</ref>, and <ref
                        target="#d678">678</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d708-f3" n="3" xml:id="d708-f3-content">
                <p>For a list of persons present at this meeting, see <ref target="#d234-f3"
                        >document No. 234, footnote 3</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d708-f4" n="4" xml:id="d708-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d704">document No. 704</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d708-f5" n="5" xml:id="d708-f5-content">
                <p>i. e., the United Nations.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
